[{"id":"c02-completion-vs-outcome","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 应用开发","tags":["Agent 应用开发","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(二)Agent任务建模.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(二)Agent任务建模","articlePath":"posts/e0697682/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(二)Agent任务建模.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(二)Agent任务建模","articlePath":"posts/e0697682/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“终止判断”的课程边界中，完成与业务结果如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先把完成的控制变量设为state，把业务结果的对照变量设为action；在相同样本上分别记录独立 Oracle，再按失败边界作出选择。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>比较完成与业务结果时，不共享缓存或副作用；保存输入、状态转移和独立 Oracle。如果路径稳定且规则确定，workflow 通常更容易验收；Agent 不是默认升级。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"d10-cancel-not-rollback","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent Harness","tags":["Agent Harness","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-harness/Agent Harness(十)调度与并发.md","articleTitle":"Agent Harness(十)调度与并发","articlePath":"posts/601fab75/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-harness/Agent Harness(十)调度与并发.md","articleTitle":"Agent Harness(十)调度与并发","articlePath":"posts/601fab75/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“副作用边界”的课程边界中，为什么“取消”不是“回滚”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>取消只提供排队可见；回滚还需要在cancel上由状态查询确认，不能只看文本或单个事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在scheduler夹具中分别运行“取消”和“回滚”，比较容量、优先级、等待与传播与清理；背压和取消是运行时语义；业务补偿要另行定义。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"d11-replay-not-same-output","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent Harness","tags":["Agent Harness","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-harness/Agent Harness(十一)运行事件与观测.md","articleTitle":"Agent Harness(十一)运行事件与观测","articlePath":"posts/3ab3983d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-harness/Agent Harness(十一)运行事件与观测.md","articleTitle":"Agent Harness(十一)运行事件与观测","articlePath":"posts/3ab3983d/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“重放限制”的课程边界中，为什么“重放”不是“相同输出”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>重放只提供可关联；相同输出还需要在order上由差异说明确认，不能只看文本或单个事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在events夹具中分别运行“重放”和“相同输出”，比较run、step、tool、error与序列、时间、父子关系；缺失事件只能说明观测不完整，不能直接断言没有执行。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"e16-average-hides-tail","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 质量工程","tags":["Agent 质量工程","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(十六)性能与成本.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(十六)性能与成本","articlePath":"posts/a89ea5fe/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(十六)性能与成本.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(十六)性能与成本","articlePath":"posts/a89ea5fe/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>在perf夹具里，怎样区分“平均值掩盖长尾”的通过与拒绝？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先把“平均值掩盖长尾”绑定到concurrency与tail；正常、越界和 Unknown 各运行一次，断言单位成本。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在perf夹具中，比较槽位、排队与p50/p95/p99，保留单位成本；缓存命中可能牺牲新鲜度；性能优化不能越过安全和正确性门禁。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-008","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","Cache-Control"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":8,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>no-cache 和 no-store 的区别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>no-cache 通常表示使用前必须重新验证，仍可能保存缓存副本；no-store 表示不要存储该请求或响应的缓存副本。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>指令名称容易造成反向记忆。最终行为还要结合共享/私有缓存、响应状态、Vary 和实现，但不能把两者都简化成“禁止缓存”。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>条件缓存可以用请求/响应字段对照：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>请求\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>响应\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>结论\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>If-None-Match\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>ETag\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可验证对象版本\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>If-Modified-Since\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>Last-Modified\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可按时间验证\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Cache-Control: no-cache\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>仍可能保存副本\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>使用前重新验证\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Cache-Control: no-store\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不应保存副本\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>禁止存储\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a5-escape","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["Shell","转义"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>未引用的反斜杠和双引号内的反斜杠有什么不同？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>未引用的反斜杠可保留空格等特殊字符；双引号内只会转义有限字符，普通空格前的反斜杠会保留。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>反斜杠的作用依赖它所在的词法上下文：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;&lt;%s&gt;\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> one\\ two       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 未引用：反斜杠保留空格\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;&lt;%s&gt;\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;one\\ two&quot;\u003c/span>     \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 双引号：反斜杠仍是普通字符\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;&lt;%s&gt;\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;one\\&quot;two&quot;\u003c/span>     \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 双引号内只转义有限字符\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>它不是“把任意字符串安全包起来”的通用语法。变量值要保持整体边界时仍用双引号；需要传递字面反斜杠时，要同时考虑 ANSI-C 引号、单引号和目标命令本身的转义规则。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"a04-xml-is-not-defense","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"AI 大模型应用","tags":["AI 大模型应用","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/llm-application/AI 大模型应用(四)Prompt与任务契约.md","articleTitle":"AI 大模型应用(四)Prompt与任务契约","articlePath":"posts/4d0efd05/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/llm-application/AI 大模型应用(四)Prompt与任务契约.md","articleTitle":"AI 大模型应用(四)Prompt与任务契约","articlePath":"posts/4d0efd05/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“实验复盘”的课程边界中，为什么“XML”不是“防御”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>XML 只是结构化表达，不能自动阻止提示注入；防御仍要隔离不可信数据、校验工具权限并拒绝越界动作。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Prompt 是可版本化的任务契约，不只是几句自然语言；目标、约束、输出、拒答和验收必须彼此一致。把这条区别落到夹具：分别构造正常、越界和撤销样本，保存给六条合成工单注入缺少版本、冲突要求和伪造命令，契约检查先拒绝不完整输入。结构化提示可改善可读性，但不能替代工具权限、输出校验和独立 Oracle。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-05-groupwise-max-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["分组最大值","并列","JOIN"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>查询每个部门薪资最高的所有员工（并列也保留），SQL 怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> e.department_id, e.id, e.name, e.salary\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> employees \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> e\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">JOIN\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> department_id, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">MAX\u003c/span>(salary) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> salary \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> employees \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GROUP\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> department_id) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> m\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> m.department_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> e.department_id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> m.salary \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> e.salary\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> e.department_id, e.id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>派生表先把每个部门压缩成 \u003ccode>(department_id, max_salary)\u003c/code>，再回连员工表恢复姓名和主键：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">employees ── GROUP BY department_id, MAX(salary)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">                    ↓\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">              最高薪派生表\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">                    ↓ JOIN department_id + salary\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">              恢复所有并列员工\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>因此 Engineering 的并列最高薪会返回两行。若题意是“每组只留一人”，必须再声明 tie-breaker（例如最小 \u003ccode>id\u003c/code>），并用 \u003ccode>ROW_NUMBER()\u003c/code> 或排序后截取；不能悄悄丢掉并列者。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-fixture-vs-hook","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["扩展边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(九)插件与 Hook 扩展.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(九)插件与 Hook 扩展","articlePath":"posts/c50d5948/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(九)插件与 Hook 扩展.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(九)插件与 Hook 扩展","articlePath":"posts/c50d5948/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Fixture 与 Hook 分别适合扩展什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Fixture 为测试函数提供依赖资源，Hook 扩展运行器的启动、收集、执行或报告阶段。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Fixture 参与的是测试函数的依赖图，Hook 参与的是运行器生命周期。可以把同一个需求拆成两条证据：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">client\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> FakeClient()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">pytest_collection_modifyitems\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">items\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 这里处理收集到的节点，而不是创建测试依赖。\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> item \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> items:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        ...\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>测试需要客户端、目录或数据时用 Fixture；需要注册选项、调整 items、观察报告或写摘要时用 Hook。不要在 Hook 中隐式创建测试参数，否则测试的输入来源会从签名中消失。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]